  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "細菌生物技術",
    "sub_ename": "MICROBIAL BIOTECHNOLOGY",
    "describe_ch": "本課程介紹生物製程中涉及的基本工程技術，一個生物製程旨在大規模培養細胞以達到產品的大規模生產。這些主題整合基礎生物學的概述、精進生物技術和工業中應用的生物製程的原理。一個生物製程技術包括許多操作單元，主要涉及菌種改良、放大發酵技術和下游純化技術等。基於此，課程中將舉例說明生物製程的設計原則。",
    "describe_eh": "This course introduces the basic engineering techniques that are involved in a bioprocess which aims to massively grow living cells  to achieve large production of products. The topics are integrated by an overview of the basic biology, the advances in biotechnology, and the principles of a bioprocess applied in industry. A bioprocess generally includes many operation units, mainly involving strain improvement, scale-up fermentation process, and downstream purification process. To this end, practical examples are illustrated to guide the design principle of bioprocesses.",
